{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main8030_grass_01",
      "hash": "1e8b06f7cbd8b52e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你好……\\n天气真好呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main8030_grass_06",
      "hash": "1e8b09f7cbd8ba47",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "真舒服……\\n……呼……呼～"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main8030_grass_07",
      "hash": "1e8b08f7cbd8b894",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……哎呀，糟糕。\\n居然睡着了……"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main8030_grass_08",
      "hash": "1e8afff7cbd8a949",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "欢迎你来到这里。\\c\\n我是玉虹道馆的莉佳。"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main8030_grass_09",
      "hash": "1e8afef7cbd8a796",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我喜欢插花，\\n宝可梦也都是草属性。"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main8030_grass_10",
      "hash": "1e8781f7cbd59d58",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……哎呀，糟了。\\n你是要申请对战吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main8030_grass_11",
      "hash": "1e8782f7cbd59f0b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "是吗……\\n我可是不会输的。"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_gymleader_04_02",
      "hash": "9fa9f03d0017d7d3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 7]"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main8030_grass_02",
      "hash": "1e8b05f7cbd8b37b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "只能把这彩虹徽章给你了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main8030_sys_01",
      "hash": "f9a1db8ce14fe26f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从莉佳那里\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]彩虹徽章[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main8030_grass_03",
      "hash": "1e8b04f7cbd8b1c8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "有了彩虹徽章，\\n即使自己不是它的初训家，\\r\\n等级[VAR NUM2(0004)]为止的宝可梦\\r\\n都会乖乖听你的话了。\\c\\n还有……\\n如果你愿意的话，\\r\\n也一定要用用这个！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main8030_sys_02",
      "hash": "f9a1dc8ce14fe422",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从莉佳那里\\n得到了[VAR ITEM2(0001)]\\r\\n“[VAR COLOR(0006)][VAR MOVE(0002)][VAR COLOR(0000)]”！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main8030_grass_04",
      "hash": "1e8b0bf7cbd8bdad",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "招式学习器53是“超级吸取”。\\c\\n这个优秀的招式能把\\n向对方造成的伤害中的一半\\r\\n转化为宝可梦的营养。"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main8030_grass_05",
      "hash": "1e8b0af7cbd8bbfa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哎呀，哦……\\n你还在收集图鉴呀。\\r\\n很是了不起。\\c\\n因为我只会去收集\\n美丽的宝可梦呢。"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_8030_max",
